<title>USA: Geneva, N.Y., repriced, top yield 5.05 pct in 2007.</title>
<headline>Geneva, N.Y., repriced, top yield 5.05 pct in 2007.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Tuesday that it repriced Geneva Industrial Development Agency's $18 million bond deal.  Top yield was 5.05 pct in 2007.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>CITY OF GENEVA INDUSTRIAL DEVELOPMENT AGENCY</p>
<p>RE: $17,695,000*</p>
<p>CIVIC FACILITY REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1997</p>
<p>( THE COLLEGES OF THE SENECA CIVIC FACILITY )</p>
<p>NEW YORK</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE THE REPRICING.</p>
<p>WE WILL TAKE LATE ORDERS IN THE FOLLOWING MATURITIES: 2000</p>
<p>THROUGH 2005. UNTIL 4:00 PM.</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 03/01/1997	   FIRST COUPON: 09/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 03/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>03/01/1998		1,490M    4.00  %	  3.70</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 100.275)</p>
<p>03/01/1999		1,555M    4.50  %	  4.15</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 100.646)</p>
<p>03/01/2000		1,615M    4.25  %	  4.35</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.724)</p>
<p>03/01/2001		1,685M    4.375 %	  4.45</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.728)</p>
<p>03/01/2002		1,760M    4.50  %	  4.55</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.778)</p>
<p>03/01/2003		1,745M    4.60  %	  4.65</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.74)</p>
<p>03/01/2004		1,820M    4.625 %	  4.75</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.265)</p>
<p>03/01/2005		1,900M    4.75  %	  4.85</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.344)</p>
<p>03/01/2006		1,995M    6.00  %	  4.95</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 107.513)</p>
<p>03/01/2007		2,115M    6.00  %	  5.05</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 107.353)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, March 12, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on March 20, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
